stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> STARTED: start(config, period)<br/>own transaction
    STARTED --> COMPLETED: report + delivery saved<br/>same transaction as complete()
    STARTED --> FAILED: exception caught<br/>fail(runId, error)
    FAILED --> [*]: next trigger inserts<br/>a new STARTED row
    COMPLETED --> [*]: later triggers return Skipped
    note right of STARTED
        A crash leaves the row STARTED.
        It is not COMPLETED, so the
        next run retries from the start.
    end note
